            is the following.
          #InjectiveResolutionOfExactSequenceByExactSequence.num_lemma
            %h6#lemma_3 Lemma
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
