              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/split+exact+sequences"} split exact sequences
              (see the discussion there). Splitness is preserved by a functor
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
