          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_6 Remark
            %p
              Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LongExactSequenceOfRightDerivedFunctorsFromShortExactSequence"}
              implies that one way to interpret
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
