              is as a “measure for how a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+exact+functor"} left exact functor
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi F
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
              fails to be an
