          .proof
            %h6#proof_21 Proof
            %p
              The proof that we have indeed a chain complex is much like the proof of the existence of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/alternating+face+map+complex"} alternating face map complex
              of a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+group"} simplicial group
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
