              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/split+exact+sequence"} split exact sequence
              by constructing for the canonical chain map to the 0-complex a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/null+homotopy"} null homotopy
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
